              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyarabahimbaye, kandi babafitiye umwenda: kuko namb’ abanyamahanga bāsangiye ivy’ impwemu vyabo, bafise umwenda wo kubafasha ku vy’umubiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
